# 统一行为 LF，终结 Windows/Unix 协作时提交警告与逐行 diff 噪音。
* text=auto
*.go text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mod text eol=lf
*.sum text eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做任何转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.webm binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
